pan\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cpre\u003e\u0026#8203;\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cpre\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cm-keyword\"\u003eimport\u003c/span\u003e (\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cpre\u003e\t\u003cspan class=\"cm-string\"\u003e\u0026quot;fmt\u0026quot;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n","lines":55,"lines_more":50,"is_public":true,"public_url_shared":false,"channels":null,"groups":null,"ims":null,"initial_comment":{},"comments_count":0,"num_stars":0,"is_starred":false,"shares":{"public":null,"private":null},"display_as_bot":false,"has_rich_preview":false,"username":""}],"upload":true,"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OeW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f261f70f-12e1-4a8c-b9af-1e7a8697ab7b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"[質問]\n↓のように、b() で発生したエラーを main() でエラー種類を見てハンドリングしたいんですが、この場合は独自のエラー構造体を定義して、構造体のフィールドにエラーの種類をもたせた方が良いんですかね…\n```package main\n\nimport (\n\t\"fmt\"\n\n\t\"\u003chttp://golang.org/x/xerrors|golang.org/x/xerrors\u003e\"\n)\n\nfunc main() {\n\terr := a()\n\tif \u003chttp://xerrors.Is|xerrors.Is\u003e(err, someError) {\n\t\t// do something\n\t}\n}\n\nfunc a() error {\n\treturn xerrors.Errorf(\": %w\", b())\n}\n\nfunc b() error {\n\treturn xerrors.New(\"some error\")\n}```","ts":"1620730457.435300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y0="}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fdd87de-bf4a-4fa4-a2b2-d833b6c60023","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"x/xerrors と errors の組み合わせで一応スタックトレース取れるし、wrapもunwrapも比較できるので、移行したほうが良いのかなって悩み中","ts":"1620728663.432900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T3le"}]},{"client_msg_id":"794eab3e-28bd-4e03-a26c-cf7094890ac6","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"Goのエラーハンドリングって今も pkg/errors がデファクトスタンダードですかね","ts":"1620728605.431800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HXeo"}]}]
